IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc8-part8-assaults`
IMPORT `ccc8-part8-harm`

-- ccc8-tests-part8-harm.l4 -- tests for ccc8-part8-harm.l4 (sections 244 to 248, 262, 263, 263.1). Expected values are written by hand from the text.
-- The stand-in below is NOT the penalty of section 787(1) (outside this part): it states nothing, so only the limb of this part is tested.
`s 247 test fixture: a stand-in for the section 787(1) penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`

§ `Sections 244 and 244.1 -- discharging a firearm or an air gun with intent`

-- 244(1) "Every person commits an offence who discharges a firearm at a person with intent to wound, maim or disfigure, to endanger the life of or to prevent the arrest or detention of any person"
#ASSERT `s 244(1) the person commits the offence of discharging a firearm with intent` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 244(1) the person commits the offence of discharging a firearm with intent` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 244(1) the person commits the offence of discharging a firearm with intent` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 244(1) the person commits the offence of discharging a firearm with intent` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
