-- 244.1 "Every person who, with intent (a) to wound, maim or disfigure any person, (b) to endanger the life of any person, or (c) to prevent the arrest or detention of any person, discharges an air or compressed gas gun or pistol at any person ... is guilty of an indictable offence ... not exceeding fourteen years"
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the person commits the offence of discharging an air or compressed gas gun or pistol with intent` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the person commits the offence of discharging an air or compressed gas gun or pistol with intent` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the person commits the offence of discharging an air or compressed gas gun or pistol with intent` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the person commits the offence of discharging an air or compressed gas gun or pistol with intent` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 244.1 the punishment` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 14, 0, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)

§ `Section 244.2 -- discharging a firearm recklessly`

-- (2) "place means any building or structure — or part of one — or any motor vehicle, vessel, aircraft, railway vehicle, container or trailer"
