#ASSERT `s 248 the punishment` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)

§ `Sections 262 and 263`

-- 262 "Every person is guilty of an indictable offence ... ten years ... or ... summary conviction who (a) prevents or impedes, or attempts to prevent or impede, any person who is attempting to save his own life; or (b) without reasonable cause prevents or impedes ... any person who is attempting to save the life of another person"
#ASSERT `s 262 the person commits the offence of impeding an attempt to save life` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262 the person commits the offence of impeding an attempt to save life` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262 the person commits the offence of impeding an attempt to save life` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 262 the class of the offence` EQUALS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `s 262 the punishment` `s 247 test fixture: a stand-in for the section 787(1) penalty` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 10, 0, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`), `s 247 test fixture: a stand-in for the section 787(1) penalty`
-- 263(1) "Every one who makes or causes to be made an opening in ice that is open to or frequented by the public is under a legal duty to guard it in a manner that is adequate to prevent persons from falling in by accident and is adequate to warn them that the opening exists"; (2) excavation on land
#ASSERT `s 263(1) the person is under a legal duty to guard the opening in ice` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 263(1) the person is under a legal duty to guard the opening in ice` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 263(1) the person is under a legal duty to guard the opening in ice` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 263(2) the person is under a legal duty to guard the excavation on land` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 263(2) the person is under a legal duty to guard the excavation on land` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
